Rule 3 (target indices must be -1 or within [0, C-1] where C is the number of classes)
{v_4 : tensor, v_5 : tensor} |= if ndim(v_4) = 1 then (min(v_5) ≥ -1 ∧ max(v_5) ≤ shape(v_4, 0) - 1) else if ndim(v_4) = 2 then (min(v_5) ≥ -1 ∧ max(v_5) ≤ shape(v_4, 1) - 1) else false
